;    0: TWdLink(count=5503, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島うつむき32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I see... So that's what it was."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\渦巻くシナプス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
"My research began with the goshinboku. 
{PAUSE ""}
If I remember right, <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, you said you knew the urban legend of Motokizakura-sama, didn't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I know it."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ様.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"She's a youkai, a woman in a beautiful kimono, and there's a good Motokizakura-sama and a wicked Motokizakura-sama. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">In the old days, some people seem to have seriously worshipped Motokizakura-sama."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you know how long that urban legend has been around?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, I wouldn't know that much..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\雑誌.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"The first time the story of Motokizakura-sama appeared was in the July issue of Shiyo 747 of 'M', the long-running occult magazine that's still published today. 
{PAUSE ""}
It was introduced as a youkai of the goshinboku that had suddenly appeared. 
{PAUSE ""}
But in the previous month's June issue, a certain murder case that happened in Shiyo 747 was run as a feature article, and the follow-up on that case was scheduled to appear in the July issue. 
{PAUSE ""}
But for some reason, what got written was that Motokizakura-sama, this heavily occult figure, was the culprit behind that murder case."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But for an occult magazine, isn't that kind of thing pretty common?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The thing is, that murder case actually happened. 
{PAUSE ""}
Don't you think blaming a real case on a youkai no one had ever heard of is far too sloppy, precisely because it's an occult magazine?
{PAUSE ""}
　A youkai people already had rumors about would be one thing, but this means a reporter at M made up Motokizakura-sama, right?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Then the truth behind that murder case is...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That murder case got swapped out for an obviously phony urban legend. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, the murder was turned into an urban legend so that it would fade from people's memories."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So what does that have to do with your research on the goshinboku?"</STYLE><PG>
"The victims of that murder case were―
{PAUSE ""}
members of a public research group that was trying to study the goshinboku at the time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean there was a research group back then too...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yes. The goshinboku, said to have sprung up out of nowhere. 
{PAUSE ""}
To study that mysterious cherry tree, the group was set up as a public institution in what was then Motoki-cho. 
{PAUSE ""}
But soon after it was set up, every member stationed in Motoki-cho was killed by someone in their lodgings."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No way..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\中央公園素材\御神木.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"That 'no way' is exactly what happens with the goshinboku, with the Arata cherry. 
{PAUSE ""}
We call this the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ナナシナ">Nanashina</STYLE> Incident―nana-shi-na, 7-4-7, after the year―but what's odd here is that, unlike the Nanashina Incident, the staff of the International Research Institute, myself included, didn't die. 
{PAUSE ""}
Do you remember how I collected samples from the goshinboku?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... what do you mean, collected samples?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"How I got the pollen, the branches, and the bits of root."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... breaking off branches, picking flowers... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">No, how did it go again...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>, do you remember?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If I remember right..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I started by collecting the pollen drifting in the air, without touching the goshinboku's flowers."<PG>
"Next I collected branches that had fallen around the goshinboku and fragments of root that had broken off above ground and examined them, and the roots contained spores too."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, I remember now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto-chan<STYLE ID="1">, you kept away from the goshinboku, or rather... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you collected without touching the goshinboku."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's right. 
{PAUSE ""}
Actually, the state instructed us to collect samples that way. 
{PAUSE ""}
As a top-priority matter, no less. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, suppose touching the goshinboku to study it was the cause of the Nanashina Incident."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't really understand, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the goshinboku―in other words, is it the idea that studying a god is presumptuous?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　After all, you were researching religion too, weren't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Not quite, but not off the mark either. 
{PAUSE ""}
The goshinboku didn't want to be studied, and as a result the research group was killed."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The goshinboku didn't want it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Um, is that what they call personification?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"How would it kill anyone in the first place...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Let me explain step by step. 
{PAUSE ""}
First, the fact that the sampling method was specified at the national level means we can say the truth of the Nanashina Incident had been worked out to some extent. 
{PAUSE ""}
The countermeasure was to collect samples without touching the goshinboku. 
{PAUSE ""}
The hypothesis we can set up here: the goshinboku has a will. 
{PAUSE ""}
To keep from being studied, the goshinboku killed the researchers by some means."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木市遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"And then there's this disaster. 
{PAUSE ""}
This disaster is clearly different from the Nanashina Incident. 
{PAUSE ""}
In the Nanashina Incident it killed only the people it had to, but this time it slaughtered nearly everyone who was in Motoki City. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, the purpose wasn't to keep from being studied; the killing itself was the purpose. 
{PAUSE ""}
Why did it need to kill?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\死体1溶けてる.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I became sure of it when I saw the footage of the body dissolving under the cherry petals. 
{PAUSE ""}
To grow that many enormous fruiting bodies, the Arata cherry must have drawn a tremendous amount of nourishment out of the earth. 
{PAUSE ""}
Now the ground of Motoki City has turned into barren land. 
{PAUSE ""}
Soil with no nutrients isn't suited to reproduction, even for the Arata cherry. 
{PAUSE ""}
So it's dissolving the bodies, returning them to the earth, and using them as nutrients."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"To sum up: the Nanashina Incident happens, and to cover it up, people's memories are overwritten with an obviously phony urban legend called Motokizakura-sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
The media back then wasn't as varied as it is now, so letting the memory fade must have been easy."<PG>
"But a public institution―
{PAUSE ""}
that is, the state, investigated the goshinboku and the Nanashina Incident behind the scenes and once again set up a dedicated research body in Motoki City. 
{PAUSE ""}
That was the International Research Institute, where I was director."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So the state wants to know about the goshinboku, the Arata cherry and Droga badly enough to go that far."</STYLE><PG>
"The government must also have found out about Droga somehow. 
{PAUSE ""}
Any country would be desperate for a drug that can easily remodel a human into a monster, so it makes sense that it's being studied at the national level."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But in the end, the researchers who touched the goshinboku were killed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Is that because the goshinboku has a will...?"</STYLE><PG>
"I think so. 
{PAUSE ""}
Because in the Nanashina Incident, the researchers were all beaten to death."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Beaten to death means..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes. It was done by human hands. 
{PAUSE ""}
There's 'someone' who doesn't want the secrets of the goshinboku and the Arata cherry to get out."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Someone is trying to protect the goshinboku's secret...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Could it be the government...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that's not it. 
{PAUSE ""}
If it were, they'd never have let us do research. 
{PAUSE ""}
If anything, the government wants to know more about the ecology of the goshinboku and the Arata cherry."<PG>
"If there's someone here in Motoki City too who's trying to kill those who learn the secret... 
{PAUSE ""}
doesn't anyone come to mind?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You mean the special unit coming tomorrow will slaughter all the survivors..."</STYLE><PG>
"No, the special unit is people the government is sending, so they're on the side doing the research―
{PAUSE ""}
if anything, they'd be on the side that gets killed. 
{PAUSE ""}
So anyone trying to kill the special unit would strike them before being investigated. 
{PAUSE ""}
Which means the culprit is someone who's already in Motoki City. 
{PAUSE ""}
Apart from us."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">In that case...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">It can only be those two...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ考えるバストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, hold on a second! Are you saying </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would kill people!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. Besides, there's no way those two could have caused the incident of Shiyo 747. They weren't even born back then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Back then, I believe the culprit was someone else. 
{PAUSE ""}
The work of a person parasitized by the Arata cherry, whose consciousness had been taken over."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Taking over someone's consciousness...?"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, listen carefully. 
{PAUSE ""}
This morning I said 'the Arata cherry parasitizes humans,' didn't I?
{PAUSE ""}
　Some parasites control the behavior of their hosts.
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\ブードゥー4.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If a person parasitized by the Arata cherry were to kill people―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"That can't be...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And you've been thinking, '<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is in the Arata settlement, isn't she?' haven't you?
{PAUSE ""}
　These aren't separate phenomena. They're all <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="つな">connected</STYLE> events."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The Arata cherry, Droga, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, parasitism, the goshinboku, the toxic gas―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto-chan<STYLE ID="4"> is right: these can certainly be strung together into a single story.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"First, the thing we most need to watch out for is that two people who seem to be <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> are wandering around this town. 
{PAUSE ""}
If we run into them, we could be killed, like in the Nanashina Incident. 
{PAUSE ""}
I have no solid proof, but it never hurts to be careful."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Say, just hypothetically, all right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the other one are the kind that do people harm, what happens to the special unit coming tomorrow?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Will they get killed after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Actually, I'm concerned about that special unit too. 
{PAUSE ""}
The special unit will be armed, at the very least, don't you think? 
{PAUSE ""}
If things go badly, we could have a small war on our hands..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that means the government knows about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and the others...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Not <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others so much as people like <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others―
{PAUSE ""}
it's possible they're anticipating beings similar to the culprit of the Nanashina Incident."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then is the special unit's purpose less an on-site disaster survey than tracking down people controlled by the Arata cherry?"</STYLE><PG>
"Most likely, yes. 
{PAUSE ""}
From the government's point of view, it's a golden chance to get hold of the truth of the Nanashina Incident. 
{PAUSE ""}
And since there are hardly any survivors, as you can see, the special unit can operate fairly freely. 
{PAUSE ""}
I don't know whether they'd capture <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others or kill them, but <STYLE ID="2">you two</STYLE> had better not go out tomorrow either. 
{PAUSE ""}
If they find out you're people the toxic gas doesn't affect, there's no telling what they'd do to you."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ラジオ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I'd been listening to the radio while we talked, but it seemed the press conference had ended with everything left vague.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">In the background, I could hear the reporters firing off one question after another.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">―Chief Cabinet Secretary! Isn't human life supposed to come first in a case like this!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">―Even among the public, voices are now being raised questioning the government's response!</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
"That was a fine piece of acting. Just what you'd expect of the Chief Cabinet Secretary."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It was as if something were being conveyed to us, the public, between the lines... 
{PAUSE ""}
Emergency or not, I can't believe the Chief Cabinet Secretary would give such a clumsy press conference. 
{PAUSE ""}
That distrust is being stirred up on purpose."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But even if that's so, what on earth..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ラジオ電池切れ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ32バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"I'd say the government has already gotten across everything it wanted to. 
{PAUSE ""}
After all, hearing that press conference just now, I was able to work out the broad outline."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\クリスタルコア.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"The moment we felt that distrust just now, the government will have achieved its goal. 
{PAUSE ""}
In other words, it's telling us to be careful. 
{PAUSE ""}
It can't say so openly, but it's giving us some kind of warning."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Is that why the remarks were so stiff, or rather, so deliberately dismissive of human life?"</STYLE><PG>
"Yes. Considering approval ratings and public opinion, they'd normally say human life comes first, like a slogan. 
{PAUSE ""}
But the fact that it's missing means either we're dealing with a naively honest fool who doesn't understand the public's feelings, or there's some other intention. 
{PAUSE ""}
Besides, do you know who this Chief Cabinet Secretary is?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Who the Chief Cabinet Secretary is? I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know! It's the person who was mayor of Motoki-cho until about 10 years ago, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
"That's right. Someone who contributed greatly to Motoki-cho's development, and under whom its crime rate was the best in the country. 
{PAUSE ""}
Even over the smallest things, the mayor personally stood on the front line and contributed to the town's development. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE>-san, who built that kind of community and was called a wise leader. 
{PAUSE ""}
If Motoki, that person's hometown, has ended up like this..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So it wasn't the government so much as an independent decision to make those remarks. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hoping the surviving people of Motoki City were listening."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's hard to <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="く">grasp</STYLE> the Chief Cabinet Secretary's exact intent, but wasn't the point to say, 'tomorrow, no one from Motoki City is to be found by anyone'? 
{PAUSE ""}
Normally I don't think a politician would be allowed to do something like this, though..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"If so, then there really is something behind it, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If it's really the way </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> worked it out..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Right. When I wondered what was behind it, I went back over it starting from the Nanashina Incident and the story of Motokizakura-sama. 
{PAUSE ""}
Our best move is to stay here and watch how things go for all of tomorrow."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE><PG>
