<STYLE ID="4">It was, unmistakably, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But she looked to be still only about 20.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> senior by a year, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> nonetheless had a youthfulness clearly far removed from her real age.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">And she was wearing that robe.</STYLE><PG>
"What do I do... 
{PAUSE ""}
How did she know this room's number...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto-chan's<STYLE ID="4"> hand on the door remote was trembling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> gripped my hand hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">By rights, it's a reunion we should be glad of.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But right now, the situation is different.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">She is the presence we should dread most of all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, let's let her in..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"W-we can't...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You know why without me having to say it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I know, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I know, but...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> tone was strong, but she didn't seem ready to go as far as grabbing the remote to open the door.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is someone she must want to let in, but her fear must be stronger than that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">I want to let </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> in right away as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But what happened at Zahha earlier keeps coming back to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">The one who had kept watching, perfectly still, as I dissolved the body was </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">If that isn't eerie, what is?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Turning her eyes from the screen and hanging her head, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> could only apologize in a tearful voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">As I thought, letting </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> in under these circumstances is...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">And then―</STYLE><PG>
