<STYLE ID="4">Seeing </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> fall, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> stood up and ran for the front door.</STYLE>
